flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B[Reset OneWire bus]

    B --> C{Reset successful}

    C -- No --> D[Return temperature error value]

    C -- Yes --> E[Send Match ROM command]

    E --> F[Set index i to 0]

    F --> G{i less than 8}

    G -- Yes --> H[Send ROM byte at index i]
    H --> I[Increment i]
    I --> G

    G -- No --> J[Send Convert Temperature command]

    J --> K[Wait for conversion]

    K --> L[Reset OneWire bus again]

    L --> M{Reset successful}

    M -- No --> D

    M -- Yes --> N[Send Match ROM command]

    N --> O[Set index i to 0]

    O --> P{i less than 8}

    P -- Yes --> Q[Send ROM byte at index i]
    Q --> R[Increment i]
    R --> P

    P -- No --> S[Send Read Scratchpad command]

    S --> T[Create data buffer]

    T --> U[Set index i to 0]

    U --> V{i less than 9}

    V -- Yes --> W[Read scratchpad byte into data array]
    W --> X[Increment i]
    X --> V

    V -- No --> Y[Combine data bytes into raw temperature value]

    Y --> Z[Convert raw value to Celsius]

    Z --> AA([Return temperature])
